 the user removing the app’s iCloud","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data in Settings — discard the instance and create a fresh one, and treat the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deletion as a full cloud reset: detach and re-attach every device that ever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"synced with the zone. Prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CoreDataEnsemble.removeEnsemble(withIdentifier:in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for resets you control; it deletes records through the framework, so all local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caches follow along and the zone itself is never destroyed."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Migrating from Ensembles 2","anchor":"Migrating-from-Ensembles-2","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The two private-database initializers write to ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"different CloudKit zones"}]},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(ubiquityContainerIdentifier:rootDirectory:usePublicDatabase:schemaVersion:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses CloudKit’s default zone ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_defaultZone"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(privateDatabaseForUbiquityContainerIdentifier:schemaVersion:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses a custom zone named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.mentalfaculty.ensembles.zone.schema2"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"E2 had the same two initializers with the same zone behaviour. If you are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"migrating an existing E2 fleet to E3 and some users may still be running"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E2 during the rollout, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use the same initializer in E3 that your E2 build"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Devices in different zones cannot see each other’s records, even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when pointing at the same iCloud container with the same schema version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Switch to the recommended custom-zone form only after your fleet has fully"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"migrated."}]},{"anchor":"Publishing-the-Schema","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Publishing the Schema"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"CloudKit schemas must be deployed to production before your app ships.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"After testing in the Development environment:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Open ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/icloud.developer.apple.com\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Select your container","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deploy Schema to Production","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Review the record types and deploy","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The schema is created automatically in Development when you first run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app, but it won’t be visible to production users until you deploy it.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Sharing","level":2,"anchor":"Sharing","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For ","type":"text"},{"code":"CKShare","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":